{
  "about": "Golden questions for the assistant eval (docs/week5-plan.md §4, step 2): evals/run.py. `expect.filters` is what the customer asked for, checked against what the understand step extracted; the same constraints are checked on every card shown (violations), from the index's copy of the dish. `cards`: some | none | any. `relevant_any`: at least one card should be one of these ('Restaurant / Item', or a restaurant name for restaurant suggestions) — reported, not a gate. `before`: earlier messages in the same conversation. `page`: the restaurant the customer is looking at. Islamabad: F-7 33.7208,73.0552. Karachi restaurants are Demo Bistro, Boat Basin, Forno Rosso, Golden Dragon, Lahori Nashta House.",
