                "relevant_any": ["Desi Dastarkhwan / Palak Paneer", "Desi Dastarkhwan / Paneer Makhani", "Desi Dastarkhwan / Yellow Daal Tadka"]}},
    {"q": "Which restaurant is best for BBQ?", "tags": ["pdf", "restaurants"],
